# Build artifacts and vendored dependencies.
# These are gitignored, but Prettier still walks them when it is run after a
# local Catalog build. Some are very large — the Xcode build manifest and the
# CocoaPods .abi.json files are 9-12 MB each — and formatting them exhausts
# Node's heap, so `prettier --write .` dies partway through and leaves the
# working tree half-formatted.
**/node_modules/
samples/Catalog/ios/Pods/
samples/Catalog/ios/build/
samples/Catalog/android/build/
samples/Catalog/android/.gradle/
samples/Catalog/android/app/build/

# Generated output. Regenerated by `npm run build-and-generate-types` and
# `npm run docs`; formatting them creates diffs that the next build discards.
lib/
types/
jsdoc/

# Generated by a tool, and the release process explicitly discards any
# formatting changes to it.
ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md

# Lockfiles
yarn.lock
package-lock.json
